  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "title": "Fleet Overview - All Services (by app)",
  "uid": "fleet-overview-by-app",
  "tags": [
    "prod-support",
    "fleet",
    "gmp",
    "sizing"
  ],
  "time": {
    "from": "now-3h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Service Detail (drill down)",
      "type": "link",
      "url": "/d/service-detail-by-app/service-detail-spring-boot-by-app?var-namespace=${namespace}",
      "targetBlank": false,
      "icon": "dashboard"
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "namespace",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${datasource}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(jvm_memory_used_bytes, namespace)",
        "label": "Namespace",
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": [
            "eod",
            "eod1"
          ],
          "value": [
            "eod",
            "eod1"
          ]
        },
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "regex": "/^(eod|eod1|eod-platform)$/",
        "description": "Tenant namespaces. eod-platform hosts the Istio gateway - it has no Spring Boot app metrics, so app/JVM columns show '-' for it while container and pool metrics still apply."
      },
      {
        "name": "nodepool_filter",
        "type": "textbox",
        "label": "Nodepool match (tenant id)",
        "description": "Stable portion of the node name for your dedicated nodepool. Cluster name and node hash are wildcarded, so this survives environment changes (dev/uat/prod).",
        "query": "173952-1-eod",
        "current": {
          "text": "173952-1-eod",
          "value": "173952-1-eod"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**How to read this table** &nbsp; \ud83d\udfe9 **Green** = healthy &nbsp;|&nbsp; \ud83d\udfe8 **Amber** = watch &nbsp;|&nbsp; \ud83d\udfe5 **Red** = act now (OOMKill risk, throttling, errors, crash loops) &nbsp;|&nbsp; **`-`** = service not yet emitting app metrics (annotations pending). &nbsp; **First actions:** Restarts red \u2192 `kubectl describe pod` (check Last State: OOMKilled vs Error) \u00b7 Throttle red \u2192 raise CPU limit \u00b7 Mem % of Limit red \u2192 raise memory limit \u00b7 very low green %s across a row \u2192 over-provisioned, review limits/requests for reclaim. Note: there is no memory throttling in Linux - memory over limit = OOMKill, so watch Mem % of Limit + Restarts."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Service Health & Sizing",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "title": "All Services - health, sizing, stability (sorted by restarts)",
      "description": "Click a service name to open Service Detail for that service (namespace and time range carry over). Traffic/JVM from app metrics (app label). Resource columns from GKE metrics: LIMIT ratios drive throttling & OOMKills, REQUEST ratios drive scheduling & reserved nodepool capacity. CPU ratios are 5-minute MAX of the worst replica so burst plateaus are visible. Restarts = restarts within the selected time range (not lifetime). Memory = non-evictable. istio-proxy excluded.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 13,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, app) (rate(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\", uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "sum by (namespace, app) (increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\", status=~\"5..\", uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "1000 * sum by (namespace, app) (increase(http_server_requests_seconds_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\", uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[$__range])) / sum by (namespace, app) (increase(http_server_requests_seconds_count{namespace=~\"$namespace\", uri!~\"/actuator.*\"}[$__range]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * sum by (namespace, app) (jvm_memory_used_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", area=\"heap\"}) / sum by (namespace, app) (jvm_memory_max_bytes{namespace=~\"$namespace\", area=\"heap\"})"
        },
        {
          "refId": "E",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, app) (rate(jvm_gc_pause_seconds_sum{namespace=~\"$namespace\"}[5m]))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "F",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(kubernetes_io:container_memory_limit_utilization{monitored_resource=\"k8s_container\", namespace_name=~\"$namespace\", memory_type=\"non-evictable\", container_name!=\"istio-proxy\"}, \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod_name\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\"))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "G",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(kubernetes_io:container_memory_request_utilization{monitored_resource=\"k8s_container\", namespace_name=~\"$namespace\", memory_type=\"non-evictable\", container_name!=\"istio-proxy\"}, \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod_name\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\"))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "H",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(max_over_time(kubernetes_io:container_cpu_limit_utilization{monitored_resource=\"k8s_container\", namespace_name=~\"$namespace\", container_name!=\"istio-proxy\"}[5m]), \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod_name\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\"))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "I",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "100 * max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(rate(container_cpu_cfs_throttled_periods_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\", container!=\"\", container!=\"istio-proxy\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]), \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\")) / max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(rate(container_cpu_cfs_periods_total{namespace=~\"$namespace\", container!=\"\", container!=\"istio-proxy\", container!=\"POD\"}[5m]), \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\"))"
        },
        {
          "refId": "J",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table",
          "expr": "max by (namespace, app) (label_replace(increase(kubernetes_io:container_restart_count{monitored_resource=\"k8s_container\", namespace_name=~\"$namespace\", container_name!=\"istio-proxy\"}[$__range]), \"app\", \"$1\", \"pod_name\", \"(.+)-[a-z0-9]+-[a-z0-9]+$\"))"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "merge",
          "options": {}
        },
